            "text": "Perfecto. Aquí tienes la consulta SQL `SELECT` para BigQuery, utilizando las tablas `concept_relationship` y `concept` del modelo OMOP, que busca todas las condiciones clínicas cuya localización anatómica corresponda a la \"estructura de la articulación de la rodilla\" (`Knee joint structure` - Concept ID `4103720`), como se especificó:\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    a.concept_id AS condition_concept_id,\n    a.concept_name AS condition_name,\n    a.domain_id AS condition_domain,\n    d.concept_id AS site_concept_id,\n    d.concept_name AS site_name,\n    d.domain_id AS site_domain\nFROM\n    concept_relationship cr\nJOIN\n    concept a ON cr.concept_id_1 = a.concept_id\nJOIN\n    concept d ON cr.concept_id_2 = d.concept_id\nWHERE\n    cr.relationship_id = 'Has finding site'\n    AND d.concept_id = 4103720\n    AND cr.invalid_reason IS NULL;\n```",
